Though 22 witnesses have been examined by prosecution but the main witnesses of the case are:-
I) PW - 1 Sh. Panna Lal (complainant/father of deceased);
II) PW - 2 Sh. Chhote Lal (Uncle of deceased);
III) PW - 3 / Sharad Chand (Cousin brother of deceased);
IV) PW - 4 / Mukesh Babu (Neighbor near the spot of incident);
V) PW - 5 / Smt. Shanti Devi (Neighbor near the spot of incident);
VI) PW - 22 Insp. S. N. Rajoura (Main IO of the case).
FIR No. 351/2014 State v. Manoj Kumar Page no. 8 of 24  3.03 PW - 1 Sh. Panna Lal deposed as per his statement Ex.PW1/A given to the SDM as aforementioned.
